WEBVTT

00:08:28.727 --> 00:08:32.672
which involves wearing a cap
studded with electrodes,

00:08:32.696 --> 00:08:35.164
128 in my case.

00:08:35.957 --> 00:08:39.568
Each electrode then measures
the electrical activity of the brain

00:08:39.592 --> 00:08:42.193
with precision down to the millisecond.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.680
The problem is, however,

00:08:45.704 --> 00:08:48.133
it's not just the brain
that's electrically active,

00:08:48.157 --> 00:08:50.895
it's also the rest of the body
as well as the environment

00:08:50.919 --> 00:08:53.633
that contains a lot
of electrical activity all the time.

00:08:53.657 --> 00:08:55.045
To do my research,

00:08:55.069 --> 00:08:58.069
I therefore need
to minimize all this noise.

00:08:58.411 --> 00:09:01.894
So I ask my participants
to do a number of things here.